      "procedure": "push s_raw into a FIFO of the last median_window raw stages; m = sorted(fifo)[(len(fifo)-1)//2] (lower median while the FIFO is not full); if first output: s = m; else if max_step is null: s = m; else s = s_prev + clamp(m - s_prev, -max_step, +max_step); s_prev = s; health_stage = s"
